## Word Scramble Game

### The Word Bank

```xiom
fn build_word_bank() -> Vec[Str] {
  let mut words: Vec[Str] = Vec[Str].new();
  words.push("PYTHON");
  words.push("JAVASCRIPT");
  words.push("PROGRAMMING");
  words.push("ALGORITHM");
  words.push("VARIABLE");
  words.push("FUNCTION");
  words.push("DATABASE");
  words.push("INTERFACE");
  words.push("COMPILER");
  words.push("DEBUGGING");
  words
}
```

### Shuffling Letters

```xiom
fn shuffle_word(word: Str) -> Str {
  let mut letters: Vec[Str] = Vec[Str].new();
  let mut i = 0;
  while i < word.len() {
    letters.push(word.get(i).unwrap());
    i += 1;
  };

  let mut result: Vec[Str] = Vec[Str].new();
  while letters.len() > 0 {
    let idx = random.range(0, letters.len());
    result.push(letters.get(idx).unwrap());
    letters.remove(idx);
  };

  let mut scrambled: Str = "";
  let mut j = 0;
  while j < result.len() {
    scrambled = scrambled + result.get(j).unwrap();
    j += 1;
  };
  scrambled
}
```

### Game State

```xiom
type ScrambleGame {
  current_word: Str;
  scrambled: Str;
  score: Int;
  rounds_played: Int;
  hints_used: Int;
}

fn new_game() -> ScrambleGame {
  let bank = build_word_bank();
  let idx = random.range(0, bank.len());
  let word = bank.get(idx).unwrap();
  ScrambleGame{
    current_word: word,
    scrambled: shuffle_word(word),
    score: 0,
    rounds_played: 0,
    hints_used: 0
  }
}
```

### Hint System

```xiom
fn get_hint(game: &ScrambleGame) -> Str {
  let len = game.current_word.len();
  let first = game.current_word.get(0).unwrap();

  let mut hint: Str = "";
  hint = hint + first;
  hint = hint + "_";
  io.println(len);
  hint
}

fn check_guess(game: &mut ScrambleGame, guess: Str) -> Bool {
  if guess == game.current_word {
    let bonus = if game.hints_used == 0 { 20 } else { 10 };
    let len_bonus = game.current_word.len() * 5;
    game.score += 100 + len_bonus - game.hints_used * 15 + bonus;
    return true;
  };
  false
}
```

### Next Round

```xiom
fn next_round(game: &mut ScrambleGame) {
  let bank = build_word_bank();
  let idx = random.range(0, bank.len());
  game.current_word = bank.get(idx).unwrap();
  game.scrambled = shuffle_word(game.current_word);
  game.rounds_played += 1;
  game.hints_used = 0;
}
```

